{"3653680": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Versus One", "steam_appid": 3653680, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as giant monsters or as heroes attempting to defeat them in this asymmetric two-player local co-op VR fighting game. Send forth minions and swing massive weapons or rocket jump around the stage and strike at them as they attempt to take you down!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Hero | PC</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demolitionist </strong>– Blast through the battlefield with rocket jumps and raining explosives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rogue</strong> – Swing across the arena with a grappling hook and strike fast with deadly daggers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Mage</strong> – Distort reality with illusions, blink from place to place whilst beaming down your foes with your arcane might.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Villain | VR</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Lich King </strong>– Hurl searing fireballs, summon spectral skulls, and unleash devastating magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The False Angel </strong>–Conjure radiant weapons, summon starfall, and skewer your enemies with agonizing thorns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Festering Hive </strong>– Command swarms of insects, choke the battlefield in vile toxins, and overwhelm all who oppose you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a roster of unique <strong>Heroes</strong> and <strong>Villains</strong>, each with their own abilities and playstyles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle it out in thrilling <strong>asymmetric VR vs. PC battles</strong>, with Steam Remote Play letting you play together from anywhere in the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy <strong>expanded combat mechanics</strong> that push the limits of typical asymmetric VR fighting games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight in a <strong>destructible environment</strong> where every blast leaves its mark.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a unique <strong>2.5D art style</strong> unlike anything else seen on VR.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as giant monsters or as heroes attempting to defeat them in this asymmetric two-player local co-op VR fighting game. Send forth minions and swing massive weapons or rocket jump around the stage and strike at them as they attempt to take you down!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Hero | PC</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demolitionist </strong>– Blast through the battlefield with rocket jumps and raining explosives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rogue</strong> – Swing across the arena with a grappling hook and strike fast with deadly daggers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Mage</strong> – Distort reality with illusions, blink from place to place whilst beaming down your foes with your arcane might.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Villain | VR</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Lich King </strong>– Hurl searing fireballs, summon spectral skulls, and unleash devastating magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The False Angel </strong>–Conjure radiant weapons, summon starfall, and skewer your enemies with agonizing thorns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Festering Hive </strong>– Command swarms of insects, choke the battlefield in vile toxins, and overwhelm all who oppose you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a roster of unique <strong>Heroes</strong> and <strong>Villains</strong>, each with their own abilities and playstyles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle it out in thrilling <strong>asymmetric VR vs. PC battles</strong>, with Steam Remote Play letting you play together from anywhere in the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy <strong>expanded combat mechanics</strong> that push the limits of typical asymmetric VR fighting games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight in a <strong>destructible environment</strong> where every blast leaves its mark.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a unique <strong>2.5D art style</strong> unlike anything else seen on VR.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Play as giant monsters or as heroes attempting to defeat them in this asymmetric two-player local co-op VR fighting game. Send forth minions and swing massive weapons or rocket jump around the stage and strike at them as they attempt to take you down!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653680/11210c00764a85c3107464ed0b661cacf7e208b6/header.jpg?t=1788077086", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653680/f7fe0b3c5911981a2b53754a9a7aad48c3204ba8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788077086", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3653680/f7fe0b3c5911981a2b53754a9a7aad48c3204ba8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788077086", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Ryzen 5 5600X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> RTX 4050<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> OpenXR<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> </li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i7-12700H<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br>